# Frontend Architecture

Normative guide: `docs/FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md`.
API contract: repo `docs/API_CONTRACT.md` + OpenAPI (do not invent fields).
Dilim kapanış: `.cursor/rules/06-integration-gates.mdc` + `npm run smoke` (rewrite; Django doğrudan yetmez).

## Layout

- `src/app` — routing only; compose features
- `src/features/<domain>` — mirrors Django apps (`firmalar`, `urunler`, …) + `auth`
- Each feature: `components/`, `types/`, `services/`, `hooks/`, `schemas/`, `index.ts`
- `src/components/ui` — shadcn shared (NX-SHELL)
- `src/lib/api` — session/CSRF client; no browser tokens

## Imports

- `app` → `features` / `components` / `lib` only
- No feature → feature imports
- Import features via `@/features/<name>` public API
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed

## Safety (kök kural: `.cursor/rules/kuyumbank-hard-rules.mdc`)

- Backend owns RBAC, tenant, price math — FE’de ticari hesap yok
- UI gizleme ≠ güvenlik; her yazmada backend RBAC
- Blind pool: supplier identity/cost buyer UI’da yok
- Sözleşme/kritik tanım: sessiz overwrite yok → versiyon
- Sahte endpoint uydurma; mock açıkça işaretli
- Card spam / aşırı radius-gradient-shadow yok; sayılar `tabular-nums` + sağa
- Idempotency-Key on mutating commerce/finance/ops writes
